## Music

The recordings in `music/` were generated by the copyright holder using a **Suno Pro
subscription**, whose terms grant the subscriber ownership of generated output together with
commercial-use rights. They are the copyright holder's material and are covered by **Part 1 — all
rights reserved**, on the same footing as the rest of the creative content. No third party licenses
them to you.

Evidence of the subscription and its commercial-use grant is retained and is a required artefact of
the legal review (ARCHITECTURE.md §35 step 15).

## Third-party material

**Models, datasets and dependencies** used by the project carry their own licences, recorded in
`pyproject.toml` and `config/models.yaml`. Nothing here overrides them.
